OL,3,CEast Sussex train derailment: How
OL,4,Cevents unfolded and what happens next
OL,6,FThere's questions about whether the
OL,7,Fhot weather was to blame for a train
OL,8,Fderailment in East Sussex which left
OL,9,F20 people in hospital - two seriously
OL,10,Finjured.
OL,12,FThe Southern train came off the tracks
OL,13,Fbetween Haywards Heath and Lewes on
OL,14,FThursday - leading to emergency
OL,15,Fservices declaring a major incident.
OL,17,FRail bosses have launched an
OL,18,Finvestigation.
OL,20,FHow did events unfold?
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/5
