OL,3,CEast Sussex train derailment: How
OL,4,Cevents unfolded and what happens next
OL,6,FThis is what we know:
OL,8,FThursday 14 August
OL,10,FThe service was the 14:24 Southern
OL,11,Ftrain, travelling from London Victoria
OL,12,Fto Eastbourne.
OL,14,FThere were around 150 passengers on
OL,15,Fboard the eight carriages of the train.
OL,17,FJust over an hour into the journey,
OL,18,Fthe driver contacted control to alert
OL,19,Fthem that the three rear coaches had
OL,20,Fderailed just north of Lewes Station
OL,21,FTunnel.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
