OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1786898895
OL,3,CEast Sussex train derailment: How
OL,4,Cevents unfolded and what happens next
OL,6,FThe driver said they believed it was
OL,7,Fcaused by a track defect and all other
OL,8,Fservices using the line were stopped.
OL,10,FOut of the eight coaches, numbers 1 -
OL,11,F5 stayed upright during the derailment.
OL,13,FCoaches 6 to 8 derailed and tipped
OL,14,Fsideways
OL,16,FCoach 7 was the worst affected and was
OL,17,Fat first inaccessible.
OL,19,FA major incident was declared.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
