PN,38604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1786898895
OL,3,CEast Sussex train derailment: How
OL,4,Cevents unfolded and what happens next
OL,6,FPolice, firefighters, the ambulance
OL,7,Fservice and three air ambulances were
OL,8,Fall sent to rescue those trapped and
OL,9,Ftreat the injured.
OL,11,FThe Energency Services reported no
OL,12,Ffatalities but two people are
OL,13,Fseriously injured.
OL,15,FEighteen others are hurt but their
OL,16,Finjuries are described as less serious.
OL,18,FAll are taken to various hospitals
OL,19,Facross Sussex for treatment.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/5
