PN,38605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1786898895
OL,3,CEast Sussex train derailment: How
OL,4,Cevents unfolded and what happens next
OL,6,FBritish Transport Police said everyone
OL,7,Fhad been safely rescued from the train
OL,9,FThe day before the derailment -
OL,10,FSouthern Rail said a safety inspection
OL,11,Fof the track between Lewes and
OL,12,FHaywards Heath was taking place.
OL,14,FThe Rail Accident Investigation Branch
OL,15,Fis now investigating and will be
OL,16,Flooking at all factors that could have
OL,17,Fcontributed to the derailment,
OL,18,Fincluding the hot weather.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/5
